// The ZOM core library.
//
// This module is the root of the standard library that ships with the ZOM
// compiler. Every ZOM program implicitly depends on it: the prelude is
// automatically imported, and the marker interfaces declared under
// `core::marker` drive the compiler's ownership and move semantics.
//
// The core library is a regular ZOM package. Its manifest lives at
// `Zom.toml` in the package root, and its sources follow the same module
// and visibility rules as any user project.
module core;
